{"type":"message","id":"fdccce25","parentId":"f572a411","timestamp":"2026-04-02T00:40:13.782Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-04-02 08:40 GMT+8] An async command did not run.\nDo not run the command again.\nThere is no new command output.\nDo not mention, summarize, or reuse output from any earlier run in this session.\n\nExact completion details:\nExec denied (gateway id=184c1736-be95-4655-ab78-1a6bac5ced88, approval-timeout): set -euo pipefail\nrepo=openclaw/openclaw\nfor n in 54952 54964 55008 55013; do\n  echo \"=== $n issue comments ===\"\n  timeout 15s gh api repos/$repo/issues/$n/comments --paginate --jq '.[] | [.created_at,.user.login,.html_url,.body] | @tsv' || echo \"ERR issue-comments $n\"\n  if gh api repos/$repo/pulls/$n >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n    echo \"=== $n reviews ===\"\n    timeout 15s gh api repos/$repo/pulls/$n/reviews --paginate --jq '.[] | [.submitted_at,.user.login,.html_url,.state,.body] | @tsv' || echo \"ERR reviews $n\"\n    echo \"=== $n review comments ===\"\n    timeout 15s gh api repos/$repo/pulls/$n/comments --paginate --jq '.[] | [.created_at,.user.login,.html_url,.body] | @tsv' || echo \"ERR review-comments $n\"\n  fi\n  echo\n done\n\nReply to the user in a helpful way.\nExplain that the command did not run and why.\nDo not claim there is new command output."}],"timestamp":1775090413648}}
